                          "String": "The effect of oral D-aspartic acid and/or L-aspartic acid (aspartic acid) on the body weight of rats was studied. Rats given the D- or D- plus L-isomers showed a greater decrease in weight and in protein, triglyceride and glycogen than did rats given the L-isomer alone. The results were discussed with reference to amino acid antagonism of opioids.",
